<title>UK: London offshore tea auction offerings.</title>
<headline>London offshore tea auction offerings.</headline>
<text>
<p>Offshore offering for the Oct 7 London Tea Auction Totalled 1,400 packages of 53.50 kgs against 1,400 pkgs on Sep 30.</p>
<p>							   Last	  Prev</p>
<p>Kenya O/Sh Pkgs	    CIF   Offshore     1,400	 1,200</p>
<p>Uganda O/Sh Pkgs	   FOB   Offshore	 nil	   200</p>
<p>Oct 7 landed packages already listed totalled 9,936.</p>
</text>
